abstract: >-
  Research software for forecasting horizon-by-cross-sectional-quantile
  surfaces of forward absolute returns using functional anchors, guarded
  residual correction, shape projection and conformal-band comparisons.
  Full empirical execution requires the original frozen input snapshot.
